### Details:

**New files added (8):**
- `docs/operations/data-retention.md` - Data retention policy documentation
- `LoyaltyAggregate.java` & `LoyaltyAggregateRepository.java` - Customer loyalty tracking entities
- `ReportingCheckpoint.java` - Event processing watermark tracking
- `DomainEventProcessor.java` - Event polling and aggregator orchestration
- `PartitionMaintenanceJob.java` - Time-series partition management
- `aggregators/` directory - 5 event aggregators (Sales, Inventory, Loyalty, Consignment, EventAggregator interface)
- 2 database migration files for new tables

