- `R2ReportStorageClient.java` - Fully implemented AWS S3 SDK integration (replaced stubs)
- `ReportingScheduledJobs.java` - Added domain event processing job (5-min intervals)
- `application.properties` - Added R2 storage, job queue, and event processing configuration

**Excluded from commit (correctly):**
- `.codemachine/artifacts/tasks/*.json` - Task tracking metadata (already in .gitignore)

The commit implements an event-driven reporting pipeline that processes domain events every 5 minutes to update reporting aggregates incrementally, enabling sub-15-minute data freshness without expensive full table scans. Report exports are stored in Cloudflare R2 via the AWS S3 SDK.
